        <isViewedAsPlainText>true</isViewedAsPlainText>
        <text>Deal Type on the Customer Profile should be Upsell. NCSP Service Line on the Customer Profile should be DB&amp;R. SITAD Product Type on the Customer Profile should be Program. Account associated to the case should be a billing account. Please ensure all these conditions are met and proceed to change the status to Document Accepted on the case record #{!$Record.CaseNumber}</text>
